    "title": "Colson Montgomery banner unveiled at League Stadium - NewsBreak",
    "text": "HUNTINGBURG, Ind. (WEHT) — Former Southridge Raider and current Chicago White Sox shortstop Colson Montgomery was back in the Tri-State to be honored at League Stadium . The bombers revealed a banner of Colson that will hang next to all time greats like Jasper’s Scott Rollen. Montgomery will fly to Pittsburgh Wednesday night to prepare for the first series back after the All-Star break. Watch the video above to hear from Montgomery about his journey in the MLB. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
